&lt;div class=&quot;BDtexte&quot;&gt;
&lt;b&gt;VD&lt;/b&gt; 1,5 m (1 &lt;abbr title=&quot;cases&quot;&gt;c&lt;/abbr&gt;), escalade 1,5 m (1 &lt;abbr title=&quot;cases&quot;&gt;c&lt;/abbr&gt;)
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;BDtexte&quot;&gt;
